      "description": "The fix-checks Jobs of the watch row in the last hour, in 3 classes and Other (#5027, #6018). Started: created or resumed. Repaired: the result line repaired or ready. No result line: none (a kill), error (the command exited 1) or deadline (the deadline ended the Job); the alert RoadmapFixChecksJobWithoutResult reads these. Other: queued (created suspended, as no model place was free), existed (a create that got 409), expired (deleted after it waited longer than roadmap.fix_checks.max_wait_minutes), round_error (a Kubernetes or a configuration error stopped the round), and the other results of the step.",
